# Everything else this service needs ignored is covered by the repository-root
# .gitignore. Keep this file limited to rules that are genuinely specific to
# hotel-engine — a nested rule that duplicates the root one silently overrides
# it, which is how this service's package.json went untracked.

# Vendored copy of the previous implementation, kept locally for reference
